*> PLB-M017 two-digit-year: ACCEPT FROM DATE and FROM DAY without the
*> four-digit forms.
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. DATES.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01  TODAY-SHORT         PIC 9(6).
01  TODAY-LONG          PIC 9(8).
01  DAY-SHORT           PIC 9(5).
01  DAY-LONG            PIC 9(7).
01  NOW                 PIC 9(8).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    ACCEPT TODAY-SHORT FROM DATE
    ACCEPT TODAY-LONG FROM DATE YYYYMMDD
    ACCEPT DAY-SHORT FROM DAY
    ACCEPT DAY-LONG FROM DAY YYYYDDD
    ACCEPT NOW FROM TIME
    DISPLAY TODAY-SHORT TODAY-LONG DAY-SHORT DAY-LONG NOW
    STOP RUN.
